    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KALKULATOR DOSIS BRITISH PROPOLIS -->
  <section id="kalkulator" class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#b91c1c_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px] opacity-15"></div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">
          Panduan Dosis Akurat
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
          Kalkulator Kebutuhan Dosis Propolis
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
          Standar British Propolis: <strong>1 tetes per 10 kg berat badan</strong>. Masukkan data Anda untuk mendapatkan anjuran takaran dan waktu minum yang tepat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-xl space-y-6">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <label for="calcWeight" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300">Berat Badan (kg):</label>
            <input type="number" id="calcWeight" value="60" min="5" max="150" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-400">
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <label for="calcAgeCategory" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300">Kategori Usia:</label>
            <select id="calcAgeCategory" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-400">
              <option value="adult">Dewasa (>12 tahun)</option>
              <option value="child">Anak-anak (1-12 tahun)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <label for="calcPurpose" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300">Tujuan Konsumsi:</label>
            <select id="calcPurpose" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-400">
              <option value="stamina">Jaga Stamina / Imunitas Harian</option>
              <option value="recovery">Pemulihan Sakit / Demam / Batuk</option>
              <option value="chronic">Asam Urat / Kolesterol / Diabetes</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <button onclick="calculateDose()" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i>
            Hitung Dosis Tetesan Sekarang
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Result Box -->
        <div id="calcResultBox" class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 font-bold">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
            <span>Rekomendasi Takaran Dosis Anda:</span>
          </div>
          <p id="calcDoseText" class="font-extrabold text-white text-base sm:text-lg">
            6 Tetes per minum, dikonsumsi 2 kali sehari.
          </p>
          <p id="calcProductSuggestion" class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Gunakan <strong>British Propolis Regular (Dewasa)</strong>. Larutkan dalam 1/3 gelas air hangat kuku. Aduk menggunakan sendok non-logam.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KEUNGGULAN & TESTIMONI -->
  <section id="keunggulan" class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-bpRed-100 text-bpRed-900 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">
          Standar Kualitas Terbaik
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Mengapa Memilih Produk BP Group?
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-100 text-bpRed-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-certificate"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-slate-900">Bioflavonoid 4x Lebih Pekat</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Dibuat dari 6.000 lebah yang bekerja keras selama setahun untuk menghasilkan 1 botol British Propolis berstandar Inggris Raya.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-slate-900">Steffi: Pemanis Sehat 0 Kalori</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Pengganti gula pasir dari daun Stevia murni dengan indeks glikemik 0. Sangat ramah penderita diabetes, keto, dan diet sehat tanpa rasa getir.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-slate-900">Sinergi Nutrisi Lengkap</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Didukung Brassic Eye untuk retina & mata lelah, Brassic Pro untuk sendi, serta BP Norway dengan asam lemak Omega-3 murni Atlantik Utara.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ SECTION (ACCORDION) -->
  <section id="faq" class="py-16 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Pertanyaan Umum (FAQ)</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Hal yang sering ditanyakan seputar produk dan kemitraan BP Group</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3" id="faqAccordion">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(1)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center gap-4 hover:bg-slate-50">
            <span>Berapa lama khasiat British Propolis biasanya mulai terasa?</span>
            <i id="faqIcon-1" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-bpRed-700 transition-transform"></i>
          </button>
          <div id="faqAnswer-1" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
            Umumnya konsumen mulai merasakan perubahan stamina dan imunitas dalam 21 hari dengan konsumsi rutin sesuai anjuran takaran berat badan.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(2)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center gap-4 hover:bg-slate-50">
            <span>Apakah produk-produk ini boleh dicampur dalam satu paket kemitraan?</span>
            <i id="faqIcon-2" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-bpRed-700 transition-transform"></i>
          </button>
          <div id="faqAnswer-2" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
            Ya, seluruh paket kemitraan (Family 3 pcs, Agent 5 pcs, Agent Plus 10 pcs, dst.) memperbolehkan Anda mencampur varian resmi BP Group (BP Reguler, BP Kids, Steffi, Brassic Eye, Brassic Pro, atau BP Norway).
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(3)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center gap-4 hover:bg-slate-50">
            <span>Bagaimana cara membedakan produk British Propolis Asli vs Palsu?</span>
            <i id="faqIcon-3" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-bpRed-700 transition-transform"></i>
          </button>
          <div id="faqAnswer-3" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
            Produk asli memiliki segel hologram berlogo British Propolis, botol kaca gelap pekat, tulisan emboss di kemasan, nomor registrasi POM TR resmi yang dapat dicek di cekbpom.pom.go.id, dan dijual dengan harga resmi yang seragam.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

